Hi Jamal,
Just wanted to ping through a note to say thanks for building EdSharp, I us=
e it in my job and it's a fantastic accessible editor. I have a question fo=
r you, do you know why after running a spellcheck through a 30  page docume=
nt I lose the last 18 pages? I have Microsoft Word 2010 installed and the s=
pellcheck works well except for this one rather important issue. Before the=
 spellcheck there is 30 pages of text, after there is only 12. Even if I st=
art the spellcheck up and immediately cancel it the same deleting text beha=
viour happens.

Any help most appreciated and thanks again for a really useful tool.

Thanks
Will


